Package: riverdata.tools
Type: Package
Title: Tool Script Runner for the River Data API
Version: 0.3.0
Description: Executes analytical tool scripts stored by the River Data API against
    JSON-shaped inputs. The API posts the script text, an entry function name and the
    resolved inputs, constants and curves; the result list is returned as JSON.
    Scripts can also be inspected without being run: parsing alone reports the inputs,
    constants, curves and outputs a script declares, which is what a tool manifest is
    written from, a syntax check, and the call structure with line numbers that the
    API's safety lint applies its policy to.
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: dplyr, tidyr, magrittr, jsonlite, utils
Suggests: pracma, signal, bigleaf
